sume tomorrow. It should tell you the goal, constraints, open loops, and next actions."],[432,"`--all`: Index all supported repository documents."],[559,"`--at <sha>`: Query a specific snapshot SHA or prefix."],[730,"`--at <sha>`: Use a specific snapshot instead of the current HEAD state."],[729,"`--budget <tokens>`: Token budget for the selected packet."],[366,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[438,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[528,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[562,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[594,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[634,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[690,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[733,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[897,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[922,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[949,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[988,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[1017,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[1049,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[1076,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[1103,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[1129,"`--cwd <path>`: Run against another repository."],[466,"`--cwd <path>`: Run initialization against another repository path. If the path is inside a Git worktree, `init` anchors to the repository root."],[751,"`--dry-run` computes the planned target path and template without writing files."],[772,"`--dry-run` computes the result without rewriting the index."],[1132,"`--dry-run` is the right default for agent automation."],[1106,"`--dry-run` is the safe first call for automation."],[952,"`--dry-run` is the safe mode to confirm that external hooks will not be removed."],[494,"`--dry-run` performs repository analysis but does not write files or create the zvec store."],[783,"`--dry-run` reports `plannedFiles`, `violationsBefore`